But I already played land for turn.\n\
So if I wait to crack fetch, I can trigger Crab twice NEXT turn? No, land drops are 1 per turn.\n\
Crack fetch is Instant.\n\
So I can fetch whenever.\n\
If I draw `Hedron Crab` next turn, I play Crab.\n\
Then I play land (Trigger 1).\n\
Then I crack fetch (Trigger 2)? No, cracking fetch puts a land *onto battlefield*. That triggers Crab.\n\
Yes!\n\
So saving fetch is optimal if I might draw Crab.\n\
And I have {U} floating that will empty.\n\
So I pass turn.\n\
Wait. mana burn? Doesn't exist.\n\
I pass.\n\
\n\
