`Psychic Frog` costs {1}{U}{B} + Exile 3 cards from GY.\n\
He has plenty of GY. `Goryo`, `Ephemerate`, `Faithful Mending`, lands...\n\
If he escapes `Frog`, he can discard `Atraxa`, then attack + draw.\n\
But `Atraxa` is 7/7 Lifelink. Reanimating `Atraxa` is the main plan.\n\
