But `Goryo` is instant.\n\
He can cast `Goryo` *next turn*.\n\
But he needs `Atraxa` in GY.\n\
So discarding `Atraxa` now is strictly better than letting Frog die with `Atraxa` in hand (unless hardcast is possible).\n\
He has 4 lands?\n\
Maybe he's bad? Or maybe he has a plan I don't see.\n\
\n\
Anyway, I pass. Frog dies.\n\
