      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Watery Grave instead of Oboro, Palace in the Clouds wastes 2 life if they want mana available this turn (for Visions of Beyond). Oboro provides {U} without any life payment and is the superior play with Ruin Crab on board since it enables future bounce-replay landfall triggers. The sequencing doesn't change the Oboro engine timing but costs unnecessary life.",
      "action_taken": "Played Watery Grave as land for the turn",
      "better_line": "Play Oboro, Palace in the Clouds to have {U} available for free (for Visions of Beyond), saving the Watery Grave for next turn when both lands would be in play anyway.",
      "type": "blunder",
