    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Visions of Beyond now draws only 1 card when the opponent's graveyard has 16 cards (19 after current Ruin Crab trigger resolves). With Ruin Crab on board and Oboro in hand (which can be replayed for repeated landfall triggers), reaching 20 cards in the opponent's graveyard is very likely within a turn, at which point Visions would draw 3 cards instead of 1.",
