    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "The player cycled Fractured Sanity before playing Polluted Delta from hand. Playing Polluted Delta first would trigger Ruin Crab's landfall (mill 3), then cracking it would trigger landfall again (mill 3 more), giving 6 additional mills from Ruin Crab. After fetching, they'd still have 2 untapped lands to cycle Fractured Sanity for {1}{U}.",
