    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Against a Mill deck running Archive Trap, playing Marsh Flats (a fetchland) risks enabling a free Archive Trap (mill 13) if cracked. With 25+ cards already in graveyard, the library is getting dangerously thin. Undercity Sewers provides similar colors (U/B) without the Archive Trap risk, and the surveil 1 is useful for finding relevant cards.",
