    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "The player is at 14 life and fetched Watery Grave instead of basic Swamp. Watery Grave will cost 2 life to enter untapped or enter tapped (same as a basic Swamp entering untapped for free). Against a mill deck that has already milled 26 cards from their graveyard, life is a precious resource. The player holds Griselbrand which requires paying 7 life to draw cards, so every life point matters. A basic Swamp provides the same black mana without any life cost and enters untapped.",
